The [[Burning Coal]] is a [[gemstone]] obtained by "lighting" the [[Lump of Coal]]. It can gain the character {{icon/heat}} when in a [[weapon]] or in the backpack, or {{icon/block}} with {{icon/cold}} resist when in other items. While it is slightly different than the [[Lump of Coal]], it is more or less an improvement, especially when {{icon/heat}} is desired.
